26 0 obj
<</Title(Before accepting the system, compare the total quota before and after every committed transfer, check that no pool has a negative balance, confirm that each request identifier has at most one committed effect, and verify that restart recovery produces the same state as a valid serial execution. These checks connect the theoretical ACID, serializability, locking and recovery concepts to the actual irrigation allocation rules.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 525 0 R>>
