812 0 obj
<</Title(The dominant pool receives 81% of 67 = 54.27 requests/s. At 20 ms per exclusive update, its maximum modeled service rate is 50/s; therefore no scheduler can make that single serialized record sustain 54.27/s without changing the)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 795 0 R>>
endobj

